{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dungeon Market Simulator</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run your own mysterious shop as a cunning dwarf in the heart of the medieval world. But this isn't your average trading game! Set deadly traps to lure outcast warriors into your dungeons, defeat them to loot mystical chests, and hunt for rare items. The more strategic you are, the more mysterious chests you'll discover and fill your shop with legendary treasures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816300/extras/7768ddcfadb8ef2a34f5277470b69da4.poster.avif?t=1764770076\" width=608 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816300/extras/7768ddcfadb8ef2a34f5277470b69da4.webm?t=1764770076\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816300/extras/7768ddcfadb8ef2a34f5277470b69da4.mp4?t=1764770076\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade over 100 unique mysterious items, increase their value, and negotiate cleverly with customers in the market. Grow both your power and your profits with promotions, upgrade totems, and clever trading strategies. In this unique simulation that combines dungeons and trading, the winner isn't just the sharpest sword; it's the best wit!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816300/extras/7c39f932908b7aa2f141833335552a79.poster.avif?t=1764770076\" width=608 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816300/extras/7c39f932908b7aa2f141833335552a79.webm?t=1764770076\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816300/extras/7c39f932908b7aa2f141833335552a79.mp4?t=1764770076\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Contact: <a href=\"mailto:darkrookinteractive@gmail.com\">darkrookinteractive@gmail.com</a></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Dawn","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3816300/2baaf6cf4175d814dcfc4336a4213f1f2f71c72f.jpg"},{"name":"Second Sunrise","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3816300/9674c51945dcb31b6067c83e67d943558c662231.jpg"},{"name":"Three Days Running","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3816300/fa89eb466c5e4e9bf52b675f9796dc2e1ba13598.jpg"},{"name":"Fourth Shift","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3816300/abf884a994995b71e8a2293a7cf9408e34ec5cee.jpg"},{"name":"Merchant\u2019s Fifth Day","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3816300/70cd5833faaec1f297e69a70dfaa49ec4842ebee.jpg"},{"name":"Sixth Sunrise","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3816300/9087a1af1f1b5048656ba5d5cfb51bb05ce0397f.jpg"},{"name":"A Week in Business","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3816300/ff3457a8dde72d88bc5e6b9e4baca879197c39d4.jpg"},{"name":"Eight Days Strong","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3816300/472ba0c22e655b2145d5d546f5827e7efc18e562.jpg"},{"name":"Nine to Survive","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3816300/a15974044f349e8ec7f2471a49085bb27ddcc58c.jpg"},{"name":"Ten Days of Trade","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3816300/0f27c615f993093484280396d3c239f4d3c061a9.jpg"}],"total":25},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3816300?t=1764770076","